{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>ViuTV遊戲節目《輪盤遊戲》第4集將傢俬店變成大型躲藏戰場，8位玩家為避過獵人追捕各出奇謀。向來以甜美形象示 …</p><p></p>\n<p>ViuTV遊戲節目《輪盤遊戲》第4集將傢俬店變成大型躲藏戰場，8位玩家為避過獵人追捕各出奇謀。向來以甜美形象示人的Chloe So今次更完全放下偶像包袱，將整張臉塗成灰色融入環境，破格造型不但令眾人幾乎認不出，更把吳肇軒嚇得當場失聲大叫。</p>\n<h2>《輪盤遊戲》傢俬店爆發躲藏戰ChloeSo灰臉現身</h2>\n<p>第4集節目安排8位玩家在傢俬店內進行躲避搜索挑戰，規則限制獵人必須在20分鐘內找出所有人。節目組耗費心思佈置場地並準備大量道具，而與193分在同一組參賽者Chloe So為求隱蔽不惜犧牲色相。她將整塊面塗成毫無血色全灰狀態，完美融入背景佈置之中，當她以這副灰臉姿態現身時，瞬間嚇壞在場所有成員，吳肇軒更當場嚇到失聲大叫。</p>\n<h2>製作組大讚參賽者投入程度ChloeSo放下包袱</h2>\n<p>節目製作組對眾人投入程度給予極高評價，直指大家完全將形象拋諸腦後。同隊成員193原本因為身高問題打算偽裝成攝影師，卻遭到Chloe So與Jason當面嫌棄。現場工作人員透露Chloe So這次化妝改造毫不介意，完全符合製作組期望玩家「為咗贏不惜一切」精神。她展現出極強勝負慾與專業態度，徹底顛覆以往甜美斯文既定印象，與Jason化身床褥及Alton裝扮成盆栽一同成為全場焦點。</p>\n<h2>Chloe So破格演出洗脫花瓶標籤昔日清純形象大反轉</h2>\n<p>過去Chloe So活躍於影視圈及模特兒界，大多以清純可愛形象示人，甚少在綜藝節目中展露瘋狂一面。這次參與由邱士縉及吳肇軒等主持陣容帶領節目，她大膽挑戰極限並放下偶像身段，向觀眾展現真實性格。同場其他玩家亦各出奇謀，例如Alton匿藏至睡著，Jason更費盡心思把自己變成一張床褥，最終獵人郭嘉駿在20分鐘內僅成功找到3人而宣告挑戰失敗。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議破天荒灰臉造型激讚女星展現專業精神</h2>\n<p>節目播出後隨即在各大網上論壇引發熱烈討論，不少觀眾對這場躲藏戰感到驚喜。大批網民湧入社交平台留言支持，有觀眾留言表示「Chloe So灰面真係好癲」、「完全認唔出係佢」，亦有人讚賞她具備綜藝天份。粉絲群組內紛紛討論她與193互動火花，並留言「估唔到女明星可以咁放」，大量截圖在網絡上瘋傳，令這場極致隱蔽挑戰成為全城熱話。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577380676381270_11906888306b09556f705a8.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ed9a9815-7bbc-4915-964d-b3b9a35c0467.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577380676381270_11906888306b09556f705a8.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577381564876864_11245522656b0955781cdc9.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"474aaf9a-4b72-4a6f-8aa3-50fdee6fcf65.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577381564876864_11245522656b0955781cdc9.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577382324155266_15851708946b09557fcefe5.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0a3c3e99-2fac-47db-b306-0c1745a14673.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577382324155266_15851708946b09557fcefe5.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577383125684506_8718686726b095587d98f0.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"4658a5fc-3d83-4ea0-b4d1-51d8b194dfe8.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577383125684506_8718686726b095587d98f0.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577383979683637_20600144906b09559086a43.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-11-27 at 18.40.53.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577383979683637_20600144906b09559086a43.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577384707944437_13998355296b095597bbc9c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6be3f5df-74ba-4d91-bec8-3d936d27bd8f.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577384707944437_13998355296b095597bbc9c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/chloe-so/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Chloe-So</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/viutv/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ViuTV</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%bc%aa%e7%9b%a4%e9%81%8a%e6%88%b2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">輪盤遊戲</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3551114\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 27 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T15:43:55.044066+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1356,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T14:30:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T15:37:29.747098+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T15:37:29.747098+00:00","content_hash":"d33f5358471ee09234577abd19423dceff0cd768107f8fa94783fba6a15789f2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}